# Go build output (see `go build -o flugwetter .` in CLAUDE.md)
/flugwetter

# The project skills are part of the repository. The global ~/.gitignore excludes .claude
# everywhere, and a repository's own .gitignore takes precedence over it -- so this
# re-includes the directory here without touching that rule for any other project. The
# directory has to be un-ignored before anything inside it can be.
!.claude/
!.claude/**
